### Complete Binary Mastery Course for Offensive Security Researchers

This course is designed to take you from understanding your first binary number to analyzing network packets, reverse-engineering executable files, understanding memory, and discovering binary-handling vulnerabilities in authorized security assessments.

The goal is not simply to learn how to convert decimal numbers into binary. The goal is to understand how computers represent information, how software processes that information, and how incorrect processing can create security vulnerabilities.

